## R-transparency proof, check 2: the larger back square alone, behind
## where the front square would sit -- its centre pixel is check 2's
## other reference value. Not third-party.
Display "transparency_back_alone.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 200 200 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [40]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "ambientlight" 1 "intensity" [0.1]
LightSource "distantlight" 2 "intensity" [1.0] "lightcolor" [1 1 1]
	"from" [5 0 -5] "to" [0 0 0]
Sides 2
Surface "matte" "Ka" [0.1] "Kd" [0.9]

AttributeBegin
	Color [0.2 0.3 0.9]
	Opacity [1 1 1]
	Polygon "P" [-1.2 -1.2 0  1.2 -1.2 0  1.2 1.2 0  -1.2 1.2 0]
AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
